@100=~Mirror all standard divine spells as arcane spells (inaccessible for normal wizard classes)~

@200=~Divine Soul, a Sorcerer kit with access to all Cleric spells~
@201=~This component requires 'Mirror all standard divine spells as arcane spells (inaccessible for normal wizard classes)' to be installed~

@300=~Primordial Spirit, a Sorcerer kit with access to all Druid spells~
